# Raw personal vault dump -- contains ID documents, transcripts, and
# github-recovery-codes.txt under 00 - Documentos/Pedro/. None of this is
# markdown gated by publish:true; the asset emitter copies files verbatim
# regardless of frontmatter, so this must never be committed as a whole.
# Reference material gets deliberately migrated out into real content
# (content/assets/, content/pt-br/resource/...) as it's processed.
content/pt-br/adicionais/
cap30.pdf

